        "id": 5255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-27T17:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Understood. I\u0027m just saying some clients may prefer a smaller file to an orientation that is simply the default. I recommended in https://issues.skia.org/issues/310510975#comment4 that we use `std::optional` to allow that behavior.",
      "parentUuid": "f1c8becb_de9a6001",
