      "message": "I\u0027m not the expert on EXIF. If we wanted other info in EXIF, would it be part of the same EXIF? It looks like it *could* be? Is there other data we might want to write to EXIF? If so, this method seems like it should be more general - at the very least, it should be renamed to `WriteExif`.",
