      "writtenOn": "2024-09-24T21:11:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe it\u0027s no big deal, but it does seem a little annoying that we created a dynamic memory write stream in `exif_from_origin`, converted it to an `SkData`, and then created another one.",
      "revId": "da24ad6235479471c85e447124a1cb684d7c635c",
