      "writtenOn": "2024-09-27T17:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think one *different* way would be to pass an `SkWStream` to `exif_from_origin`, instead of having it return an `SkData`. I don\u0027t know that it\u0027s \"better\", though. I\u0027m fine with being consistent with other uses.",
      "parentUuid": "87182d14_3b97f972",
      "revId": "da24ad6235479471c85e447124a1cb684d7c635c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
